A devastating tornado outbreak is currently sweeping through the Southern United States, leaving a trail of destruction and highlighting the increasing volatility of our climate systems.
As of March 15, 2025, multiple states have reported significant tornado activity, with forecasts indicating that the severe weather conditions may persist in the coming days [@noaaspc].â€‹

