*The Java Story* joins a genre that Cult.Repo â€” short for Culture Repository â€” helped establish: professionally produced documentaries on programming languages, with earlier entries covering C++, Python, and React. Those films originated with Honeypot, a tech recruiting platform that funded them to build its developer audience. In 2019, Honeypot was acquired by XING, which later rebranded as New Work SE. Cult.Repo founder Emma Tracey subsequently bought the production company back from New Work SE, reuniting the original team, according to The Register. *The Java Story* is Cult.Repo's first release under independent ownership.

The film features Gosling alongside Mark Reinhold and Brian Goetz, both senior Oracle Java architects. Where earlier entries in the series required, as The Register put it, "a Hollywood-style effort to construct a Hero's Journey" around slower progressions, Java arrived with what the same publication calls "a veritable Love Island of dramas" already in the record â€” and enough of them, it turns out, to fill a documentary without embellishment.ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;v_FDStNmiZjviG8KAzPObXm5xmGaC0sw8vCEkK0x3KYƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkgcurrentƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;VqImtAdgDCY_ynNYZJeSZ3T7UKGkecIfjrX3oa395hAƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;5FAe1c9iT2cWiMA4CqRDDQA6fOPRtVghQLzOvhe-l4Uƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkd9714ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;VoiM41dazlF9B4Mg9DiTKEAtT7Mi_rUPTynkbPrVC1kƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;OhaIybv0ONOqEUoCEatBqtYIQiRNuQZgX1l4h6XsChQƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;EEypbNlkybReqGqdLXvS_5wJ4MOBMcHSAEdgoRErMPMƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkefalseƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;2j9MmE-KHmepH7UJEQ1np8Ao4-OM6brUwewmj4i7X9Uƒdpairƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;If81-uJVwj-8t_exzY9iwN3Vgdzg7guo3ldAphyj5Wgƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkgWeatherƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;_WVETuI160D1fAdKOsr_Cd9Q8BWYyDH3uxwIkkwa2hcƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒeri